WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.061
Beauty raced through the castle.

2
00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:10.698
Food was splattered all over her dress.

3
00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:14.601
"Running away was a mistake," she thought.

4
00:00:14.602 --> 00:00:17.424
"Beast will be furious!"

5
00:00:17.425 --> 00:00:23.738
Beauty ran toward her room.

6
00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:27.584
But she was in the wrong hallway!

7
00:00:27.585 --> 00:00:31.175
Beauty flew up the stairs.

8
00:00:31.176 --> 00:00:36.325
"Ugh!" she thought. "This castle is so big!

9
00:00:36.326 --> 00:00:38.922
Where is my room?"

10
00:00:38.923 --> 00:00:43.150
Beauty turned another corner, then she saw it.

11
00:00:43.151 --> 00:00:46.666
"Thank goodness!" she thought.

12
00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:50.687
Beauty threw the doors open and ran inside.

13
00:00:50.688 --> 00:00:53.638
But this wasn't her room.

14
00:00:53.639 --> 00:00:55.720
She turned to leave.

15
00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:58.498
But something stopped her.

16
00:00:58.499 --> 00:01:03.205
On one wall was a painting of a handsome prince.

17
00:01:03.206 --> 00:01:07.852
On another wall was a painting of a beautiful queen.

18
00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:12.026
Beauty stared at the faces in the paintings.

19
00:01:12.027 --> 00:01:16.175
"They look so familiar," she whispered.

20
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.698
But then she shook her head.

21
00:01:18.699 --> 00:01:22.675
"I never met a prince or a queen before."

22
00:01:22.676 --> 00:01:26.687
Something else caught her eye.

23
00:01:26.688 --> 00:01:30.753
Under a glass dome lay a red rose.

24
00:01:30.754 --> 00:01:37.759
"How pretty!" Beauty stepped closer. "Oh!"

25
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.235
The rose had lost a few petals.

26
00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:45.473
"Oh no, it's dying," Beauty thought.

27
00:01:45.474 --> 00:01:48.424
"Perhaps it needs some water."

28
00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:52.131
She reached for a pitcher when the doors flew open.

29
00:01:52.132 --> 00:01:55.858
Bam!

30
00:01:55.859 --> 00:02:02.090
Beast stomped inside. Roar!

31
00:02:02.091 --> 00:02:05.054
His eyes were lit with fire.

32
00:02:05.055 --> 00:02:09.387
"I told you to never come in here!"

33
00:02:09.388 --> 00:02:14.139
"I . . . I . . ." Beauty tried to be brave.

34
00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:16.906
"I didn't realize . . ."

35
00:02:16.907 --> 00:02:21.280
Beast beat his chest and roared loudly.

36
00:02:21.281 --> 00:02:23.779
Then his claws popped out.

37
00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:27.088
"How dare you!"

38
00:02:27.089 --> 00:02:38.143
Beauty screamed and ran from the room.

39
00:02:38.144 --> 00:02:44.267
She dashed out of the castle and into the rain.

40
00:02:44.268 --> 00:02:47.877
Thunder and lightning crashed around her.

41
00:02:47.878 --> 00:02:52.839
And still Beauty kept running.

